Output "out/hero.gif"
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "kit tui --root $KIT_DEMO_ROOT"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "The unit tests fail. Find the bug, fix it, and run the tests again."
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 90s
Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
